Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,WETHER FORECAST!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you steal it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it just now when you got\Nblown away by Jolyne's punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You must return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back to me this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot comprehend the forces\Nwith which we're meddling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you finally remember\Neverything now, Pucci?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there. It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rainbows...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heavy. Forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Devil's Rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for? Your\Nanswer me. I was sitting in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,that seat you know get\Nyour disgusting hands off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.82,0:01:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,me you asshole i'll kill
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,me sir that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,bench is reserved for\Npatients at this hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't give a damn who it's for if\Nyou really want him to sit so badly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about you take the bench's\Nplace and let him sit his ass on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy isn't our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a random doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you plop down on\Nthat, you fractured bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you going, Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So Weather Forecast is my new name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, I don't really\Nhave a problem with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with him all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.22,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a completely different person!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been repeated by the.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,fate of the fate of the world?.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the sky to the sea!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting through!.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The meaning of living in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens, fall me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the rainbows!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The rainbows are getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Things aren't looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you with one last blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My arm! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only gonna get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you guys are in trouble,\Nbut you're not the only ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, when did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You should take this as a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, don't\Ntouch the rainbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Father Poochie tried to stop all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,These are weather forecasts, rainbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.82,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Stan has the ability\Nto control the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that his memories\Nhave been returned to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,he could even destroy the\Nozone layer if he wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The ozone layer is way\Nup there in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what'll happen if\Nweather decides to mess with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is we'd be totally screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.68,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:04:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a huge gamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to use weather\Nforecast to my advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I can continue to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Was my arm melted because of\Nthe destroyed ozone layer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that these rainbows mean\Nweather forecast has his memory back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's his subconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather forecast stands sometimes\Nfunctions unconsciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The climate can be quite a\Ndifficult thing to control,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so there are instances where it manifests\Non its own without him even noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is, he never should\Nhave had his memories returned to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to stop the rainbows,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you either need to kill\NWeather or find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to extract his memories\Nfrom him once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I don't believe you're capable\Nof taking Weather's life, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you cannot, everyone here\Nwill die before the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that is everyone\Nexcept for me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't let Versus\Nget away if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Versus is getting away too, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Two women are down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.19,0:06:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The hole was this shallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have deactivated Netherworld\Nwhen he ran off like a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.74,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see two men run from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen you two somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your faces were on some mug shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,More rainbows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.76,0:06:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're outside, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.28,0:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You ladies are the escaped prisoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull that right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids, don't touch those rainbows!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even go anywhere near them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When you touch those rainbows,\Nsnails come out of your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Forecast was\Nable to make frogs rain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,down from the sky during\Na freak storm once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But this situation is nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this have to do with\Nweather's ability to control weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And how does it connect to\Nthis bizarre phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.74,0:07:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something really strange about\Nthe people who have snails on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like they're zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This shit is fucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.70,0:08:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be that stand users Have a\Nhigher tolerance to this phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,than everyday people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Jolene, which one of them\Nare we going after first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will be the first to get\Ntheir ass handed to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Weather Forecast our new enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, are we going to continue\Ntracking down Father Poochie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who exactly are we supposed\Nto be fighting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This new Weather Forecast\Nto SS Memory's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our enemy, isn't he? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.06,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Forecast is an ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But Versus still is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear the priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He said not to let Versus get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Digging up the past is\Nhis stand's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He might be able to\Nexcavate Weather's memory
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.90,0:09:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,disk and put an end to\Nthis rainbow apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we want to catch up to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got to find our way\Nout of this hospital first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.99,0:09:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you headed toward the\Ndirection of Jolene or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.18,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Much more than that damn priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Before he can get to it, I have to get\Nmy hands on the power to go to heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and maybe then I can finally be\Nhappy like I've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there is only one thing\Nthat I, Versus, need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dig there, Netherworld!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've excavated the memory held in the\Nground of them arriving to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how we're closer to\Ntracking down Father Pucci,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,this would be the safest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We should do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving the Speedwagon Foundation\Nthe disc with my father's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our best bet to give it to them\Nwhile I have the priest's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith that Emporio\Ncan handle it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, my dad will be back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So the friend who Jolyne\NCujoh was talking to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,over the radio earlier\Ngoes by the name Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.08,0:10:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even Father Poochie knew a\Nthing about this mystery person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't dug up this Emporio guy's face\Nyet, so I don't know what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to all of this mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it's likely that he hasn't had a\Nchance to meet with the Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and that means he's still in\Npossession of Jotaro Kujo's disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And from what the priest has told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll learn how to get to\Nheaven by reading said disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.66,0:10:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can get a hold of that disc,\NI'll be able to go to heaven too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And my only shot at it is while\Nthese rainbows are still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I'm gonna\Nmake Jotaro Kujo's disc mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These things keep multiplying and spreading\Nout all over the ground in layers!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a giant snail orgy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The freaks are procreating\None after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a fun fact snails\Ndon't have a gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever they pierce each other\Nwith those tentacle things on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,their heads they start popping out\Nbabies all over the damn place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh good fucking grief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.88,0:11:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an organism that can have\Nsex with anything it encounters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.43,0:11:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest I'm a little jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh, that's actually disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes! Yeah? Smack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Possessing two abilities\Nat once is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather Forecast's ability should\Nonly be to control the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.76,0:11:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.42,0:12:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,what we know as oxygen\Nwas created when the first
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,forms of plant life sprang\Nto existence on our Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,When an additional oxygen atom\Nattaches to the O2 oxygen molecule,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the gas becomes O3, which is more\Ncommonly referred to as the ozone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike oxygen, ozone is quite dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It exists as a thick shell roughly 20 to\N25 kilometers from the Earth's surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.98,0:12:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If one day the ozone layer were to\Nbe suddenly destroyed completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,what would happen to all living\Nthings that reside on planet Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.30,0:12:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are not capable of\Npredicting weather anomalies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,they can only work with\Nknown data and hypothesize
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,about the weather using\Npast records and instances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep looking who\Nthe hell could they be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,her friend has to be\Nsomewhere nearby I'll find
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the Guy and when I do\NI'll take it from him I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,can't let him give joshiro\Nsisk to the foundation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:12:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to look out for the ones who\Nare headed to the hospital knowing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.06,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that jolene is still inside He\Nwouldn't run away like a coward the one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,who heads toward the hospital to\Nhelp her must be Emporio I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,keep my eye out for someone who's\Nreacting differently from everyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.91,0:13:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lose this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be happy at\Nthe end of all this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Jolyne, I want\Nto help you. But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get your dad's\Ndisc into the hands
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Speedwagon Foundation's messenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to her that I would\Nkeep Jojiro's disc safe no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and that should be my top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When I called the Foundation, they said\Nsomeone will be here in five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single person\Nmaking their way to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought finding him was gonna be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever he is, he has to\Nbe somewhere around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolyne, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to Netherworld!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have just asked\Nthe ground from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With Jolene's memories, it was simple\Nenough to find Emporio's phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be the phone he used\Nto tell Jolene which seats
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,on the plane were safe so\Nshe didn't die in the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had to dig up the number from Jolene's\Nmemory, and now I know the number too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Still though I wasn't\Nexpecting him to be a kid
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.94,0:14:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,a kid that not even the\Npriest knows about quite
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,a surprise huh huh wait
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,what the disc isn't even
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,on his body and where\Ndid the phone go I could
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.68,0:14:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,have sworn it was just\Nin his hand am I losing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,my mind hold on chill\Nout I can find where he
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,hid it by excavating his\Nmemories and learn what
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Happened. Oh shit, fuck me,\Nthey're coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.42,0:15:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,did versus really go\Nthis way Jolene yeah I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.54,0:15:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,can sense his presence\Nif I remember correctly
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the way Emporio went too that's\Nweird huh do you think he could be after No,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither Versus nor the priest know of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Their body is... Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good. Dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,These slimy bastards are\Nactually real snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.66,0:15:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so slippery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't think this\Nfreaky shit is an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.50,0:16:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, don't you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go after Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw him getting dragged\Naway, too, in that bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what Versus is up to,\Nbut he's definitely after Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.02,0:16:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My body has become as slow as a snail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me,\Ngrab a hold of my rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And pull it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-five-sixty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget we're in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They love football here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go play some?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene Cujoh, enjoy getting\Ndragged into the end zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do anything moving that slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, it'll take you a while\Nto get back over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it's dangerous if\NI touch these things too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake. A\Nmoment ago, he was still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,holding on to the memory\Ndisc of Jolene's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But a split second later\Nthe disc vanished out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,of thin air is this\NEmporio stand ability he's?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Storing and extracting items\Nfrom somewhere that must be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,how he hid it but how do i find\NWhere he's keeping the disc
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll take another look what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene's gone, but where to she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.64,0:17:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,shouldn't be able to move that\Nfast in her current conditions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't friggin' believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She rolled over to get close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With her body all soft\Nand slimy right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,she easily slid inside of the\Nbroken pipe to make her move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she's gonna fuck you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Another world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit you surprised\Nme with that rolling stunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But with the state you're currently in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,compared to my netherworld,\Nyou're basically powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, I dug up more memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,like the memory of the salt\Nfrom the evaporated seawater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, if you want to\Nget rid of slugs or snails,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,salt is their ultimate weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Emporio was hiding the\Ndisc somewhere on his person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have a secret pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be hiding\Nit inside of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our stands are rather similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So his stand's ability is\Nstoring the memories of objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo's disc belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally in my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one more step closer to attaining what\NFather Poochie has been searching for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuline!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If this was going to\Nwork, I had to use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be able to save\Neveryone because you touched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And luckily, he touched you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.24,0:19:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's feeling the\Nsensation all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move forward at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:19:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.65,0:20:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to pin him down this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Speedwagon Foundation's\Ncourier's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're on standby until\Nthey can get closer to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nice! Hotwire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You still got it, former car thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm innocent regarding that\Nwhole stolen car incident!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I'm just playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't try running away if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even if I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the driver?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They were here before,\Nand now the seat's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But all that's left are these shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:20:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm starting to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.39,0:21:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did to\Ncause these snails to show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,or how it's even possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm starting to get an idea\Nof how this phenomenon's going to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their predators!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,These bugs hunt down the snails\Nin order to feed on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, snails move slow as hell, so\Nbeing devoured is how they usually go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So in situations like this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the bugs crawl into their shells, bite\Ninto their heads, and suck on their flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's because of\Nthis gruesome method of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,eating that these bugs are\Nknown as snail suckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I said to wait! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the one who caused this madness you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.61,0:21:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.46,0:22:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That man, he's heading\Ncloser to us as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, he's somewhere\Nwithin a 20 meter radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean the priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My only reason for\Ncontinuing to live is to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.94,0:22:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,settle the score with\Nhim once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than he.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.94,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.18,0:23:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.30,0:24:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
